去的？","unit":3},{"en":"We went there by plane.","zh":"我们坐飞机去的。","unit":3},{"en":"Sounds great!","zh":"听上去不错！","unit":3},{"en":"There was no library in my old school.","zh":"我以前的学校里没有图书馆。","unit":4},{"en":"Tell us about your school, please.","zh":"请给我们讲您的学校吧。","unit":4},{"en":"How do you know that?","zh":"你怎么知道的？","unit":4},{"en":"There were no computers or Internet in my time.","zh":"我那时候没有电脑也没有网络。","unit":4},{"en":"Before, I was quiet. Now, I’m very active in class.","zh":"以前我很安静。现在我在课堂上","unit":4},{"en":"I was short, so I couldn’t ride my bike well. Now, I go cycling every day.","zh":"我以前个子小，自行车骑得不好。","unit":4}]},"proverbs":{"name":"谚语","items":[{"en":"Better to ask the way than go astray.","zh":"问路总比迷路好。"},{"en":"Horses for courses.","zh":"知人善任。"},{"en":"Think today and speak tomorrow.","zh":"三思而后言。"},{"en":"A friend in need is a friend indeed.","zh":"患难见真情。"},{"en":"Like father, like son.","zh":"虎父无犬子。"},{"en":"No pleasure without pain.","zh":"没有苦就没有乐。"},{"en":"Less is more.","zh":"少即是多。"},{"en":"All work and no play makes Jack a dull boy.","zh":"只工作不玩耍，聪明杰克也变傻。"},{"en":"All’s well that ends well.","zh":"结果好，一切都好。"},{"en":"Life is what you make it.","zh":"生活是自己创造出来的。"}]}}}